{"lyrics":"[Intro]\n[00:05.08] Ooh, all I wanna do, oh, oh (Get high with my friends)\n[00:09.10] All I wanna do is get high with my friends\n[00:12.34] Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah-oh\n[00:16.26] All I wanna do\n[00:16.96] Hahaha\n[Chorus]\n[00:18.64] All I wanna do is get high with my friends (Friends)\n[00:21.00] If I die in the process, it'll be the end (End)\n[00:23.06] Just a kid from the projects, I was born to win (Win)\n[00:25.54] In a world full of darkness, I was born to sin (Sin)\n[00:26.90] Getting stuck in the past tense, 'cause the present ain't shit but elastic (Elastic)\n[00:29.12] They stretching the truth like it matter (Matter)\n[00:38.80] Getting high off my thoughts, but I manage (Manage)\n[00:40.42] Things ain't going exactly as planned (Exactly as planned)\n[Verse 1]\n[00:42.46] Devil on my shoulder like, \"What's up?\"\n[00:44.14] I look back, I'm like, \"What's up?\"\n[00:45.04] He spoke up, he said, \"Good luck\"\n[00:46.34] I said, \"I don't need luck\"\n[00:48.56] Then, he pulled out the blue pills\n[00:50.96] Damn, I think I need 'em\n[00:52.48] Damn, I think I need 'em\n[00:53.80] Damn, I think I need 'em\n[Chorus]\n[00:55.08] All I wanna do is get high with my friends (Friends)\n[00:59.16] If I die in the process, it'll be the end (End)\n[01:01.46] Just a kid from the projects, I was born to win (Win)\n[01:03.94] In a world full of darkness, I was born to sin (Sin)\n[01:06.22] Getting stuck in the past tense, 'cause the present ain't shit but elastic (Elastic)\n[01:10.46] They stretching the truth like it matter (Matter)\n[01:12.94] Getting high off my thoughts, but I manage (Manage)\n[01:14.98] Things ain't going exactly as planned (Exactly as planned)\n[Verse 2]\n[01:18.04] Things ain't going exactly as planned\n[01:19.76] Making mistakes but I say to myself:\n[01:21.80] \"The mistakes that I make, they won't happen again\"\n[01:24.36] So even when I lose, lil' nigga, I win\n[01:26.62] I don't got nothing to lose, I got everything to win\n[01:29.02] Favorite pill-color blue, take two with the Gin\n[01:31.44] Cold sweats, stomach fucked up, what the fuck, bruh?\n[01:33.94] I'm going through the same withdrawals again\n[01:36.58] Lost in my mind, I know its a trance\n[01:38.74] I'ma fly high, nigga, in these D&G pants\n[01:41.18] If I die high, nigga, just know I was mad\n[01:43.18] That I ain't get a chance to get high again\n[Bridge]\n[01:44.34] Chance to get high again (Chance to get high again)\n[01:47.24] Chance to get high again (Chance to get high again)\n[Chorus]\n[01:54.78] All I wanna do is get high with my friends (Friends)\n[01:57.34] If I die in the process, it'll be the end (End)\n[01:59.12] Just a kid from the projects, I was born to win (Win)\n[02:01.20] In a world full of darkness, I was born to sin (Sin)\n[02:04.20] Getting stuck in the past tense, 'cause the present ain't shit but elastic (Elastic)\n[02:07.16] They stretching the truth like it matters (Matters)\n[02:09.22] Getting high off my thoughts, but I manage (Manage)\n[02:10.74] Things ain't going exactly as planned\n[Verse 3]\n[02:12.72] Standin’ on my shoulder like “What’s up?” (What’s up)\n[02:15.02] I turn back and say “What’s up?”\n[02:15.88] They turn back and say “Good luck”\n[02:16.86] I said, “No I don’t need luck, why?”\n[02:17.68] ‘Cause I am high as fuck\n[02:18.44] How many? I said two percs, yeah\n[02:19.60] How many? I said two percs, yeah\n[02:20.34] It don’t even feel like it’s workin’\n[02:21.26] Feel like a whole different person\n[02:22.32] Nigga just watch it\n[02:22.94] Ima tie this shit, tie it like dreadlocks\n[02:24.38] I ain’t wrestling a pussy but I headlock uh, uh\n[02:27.00] She ain't your wife bitch, Hannah Montana, huh, uh, uh\n[02:28.74] Chrome on me, no freeze\n[02:29.88] Choppa on my hip, nigga no freeze\n[02:31.12] No cocaine, that's a nosebleed\n[02:32.20] Fuck niggas think that they know me\n[02:33.20] Outer space, I don't got no peace\n[02:33.94] Gun on my hip, yeah my piece\n